BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ithaca-frikes-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-frikes-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270630
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270701
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agioi Apostoloi\, Frikes
LOCATION:Frikes\, Ithaca\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The first panigiri of the Ithacan summer\, on the little harbour of Frikes for Peter and Paul: liturgy\, then tables on the quay with grilled meat\, local wine and a live band until morning. Half the crowd comes off the yachts moored a few metres away\, so it is more cosmopolitan than most\; the municipality lists it for 30 June\, and Frikes also throws a second summer party around 10 August.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ithaca/#frikes-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-frikes
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ithaca/#frikes-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-frikes
END:VEVENT
