BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ithaca-exogi-panigiri-of-agia-marina-exogi-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270716
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270718
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Marina\, Exogi
LOCATION:Exogi\, Ithaca\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Exogi is the highest village on Ithaca\, and its panigiri for Agia Marina fills the small square with its huge view over the north of the island: service in the evening\, then food\, wine and live music with dancing that often goes to sunrise. The road up from Stavros is narrow with hairpins\; go up before dark and park at the entrance to the village.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ithaca/#exogi-panigiri-of-agia-marina-exogi
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ithaca/#exogi-panigiri-of-agia-marina-exogi
END:VEVENT
